# Build context hygiene — keep the image build fast and free of host-local noise.
/out/
/.git/
/.github/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# GCP service-account keys / other local secrets — never enter the build context, even transiently
# in the build stage (only var/conf is COPY'd into the runtime stage, but keeping them out of the
# context entirely is the safer default).
var/*.json
*.swp
.DS_Store
*_test.go
/docs/
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
SECURITY.md
# Node/Next host artifacts (a future web image rebuilds these in-container; never ship host copies).
/web/node_modules/
/web/.next/
